mw2coop patch for maps/gulag_ending_code.gsc (The Gulag, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_gulag.gsc.

1. The cave-in chase out of the tunnels is for both players: each one's screen darkens by his own
   distance to the collapse, and it buries whichever player it catches or who runs the wrong way
   (before, only player 1 was followed: a lagging player 2 was never caught; QA tour 2026-10-22).
   Being buried fails the mission for both, as dying there does alone.
@@@ subst chase_train_kills_player_if_it_gets_close
level.black_overlay fadeOverTime( 0.2 );
@@@ to
level.black_overlay fadeOverTime( 0.2 );
		maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_chase_fade( self.origin, max_black, black_range );
@@@ end
@@@ subst chase_train_kills_player_if_it_gets_close
if ( chase_dist < 260 )
@@@ to
if ( maps\_mw2coop_gulag::cavein_catches( self.origin, chase_dist, 260 ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst chase_player_dies_if_goes_wrong_way
if ( level.player istouching( volume ) )
@@@ to
if ( maps\_mw2coop_gulag::anyone_touching( volume ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_screen
level.black_overlay destroy();
@@@ to
level.black_overlay destroy();
		maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_black_screen( false );
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_screen
level.black_overlay = hud;
@@@ to
level.black_overlay = hud;
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_black_screen( true );
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_dies_to_cavein
if ( flag( "player_died_to_cave_in" ) )
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_gulag::cavein_default();
	if ( flag( "player_died_to_cave_in" ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_dies_to_cavein
level.player
@@@ to
level.mw2coop_cavein_player
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_death
level.player
@@@ to
level.mw2coop_cavein_player
@@@ end

2. The earthquakes on the way out (stumble_trigger_think) and the fall in the cafeteria for both players (night audit 2026-11-17;
   maps\_mw2coop_gulag::fall_*): the stumbles tilt both views (both stand on the same ground: the shared ground reference), and in the
   cafeteria each player is knocked down: rumble, his own fall turned from where he looks, a death shield, a quarter walk speed, health
   down to 5, the blur, prone and a moment of black. Before, player 2 stood on unhurt at full speed and only his weapons went with
   player 1's.
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
level.player PlayerSetGroundReferenceEnt( player_ent );
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player PlayerSetGroundReferenceEnt( player_ent );
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
level.player PlayRumbleOnEntity( "light_3s" );
	level.player delaycall( 1.5, ::PlayRumbleOnEntity, "heavy_2s" );
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
	{
		mw2coop_player PlayRumbleOnEntity( "light_3s" );
		mw2coop_player delaycall( 1.5, ::PlayRumbleOnEntity, "heavy_2s" );
	}
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
level.player disableweapons();
@@@ to
level.player disableweapons();
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::fall_partner_hit( eq_view_roller, ::player_blur_manager );
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
eq_view_roller RotateTo( ent.angles, timer,
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_gulag::fall_rotate( eq_view_roller, ent.angles, timer,
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
level.player setstance( "prone" );
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player setstance( "prone" );
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
black_overlay.alpha = 1;
@@@ to
black_overlay.alpha = 1;
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::fall_partner_black( true );
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
level.player allowcrouch( true );
	level.player allowstand( true );
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
	{
		mw2coop_player allowcrouch( true );
		mw2coop_player allowstand( true );
	}
@@@ end
@@@ subst stumble_trigger_think
black_overlay destroy();
@@@ to
black_overlay destroy();
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::fall_partner_black( false );
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_blur_manager
level.player
@@@ to
self
@@@ end

3. Price's cell (player_gets_knocked_out_by_price): player 1 lies under Price's gun, his view on the scene's rig at the floor; his co-op body stood at his
   origin, 50 units under the floor, and player 2 saw it sunk to the chest with the name over it (owner's screenshots 2026-11-27). Player 2 sees a
   stand-in lying there instead (maps\_mw2coop_gulag::knocked_down_view).
@@@ subst player_gets_knocked_out_by_price
level.player PlayerLinkToBlend( player_rig, "tag_player", time, time * 0.4, time * 0.4 );
@@@ to
level.player PlayerLinkToBlend( player_rig, "tag_player", time, time * 0.4, time * 0.4 );
	level thread maps\_mw2coop_gulag::knocked_down_view( player_rig );
@@@ end
